  m_text: 'The path is on SERVER01, not on this machine - which is the whole point.
    The account''s documents survive a reimaged client, and they are on the disk
    that gets backed up.


    A path still starting C:\Users means the policy has
    not applied. Sign out and in again before assuming it failed.'
