  m_text: 'LO2.4 - Promoting the domain created the forward lookup zone automatically,
    but not the reverse one, which is what lets a technician resolve an IP address
    back to a name.


    In DNS Manager > Reverse Lookup Zones > New Zone > IPv4,
    type the Network ID.'
