  m_text: 'LO2.3 - Installing AD DS does not create a domain. The server must still
    be promoted.


    Click the notification flag in Server Manager > ''Promote
    this server to a domain controller'' > ''Add a new forest'', then type the root
    domain name.


    The server restarts afterwards and you sign back in as a domain
    administrator.'
