      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'LO2.4 - Move to CLIENT01.


    A client that is not a domain member cannot
    use domain accounts, receive Group Policy, or be managed from the server - so
    nothing after this point would work.


    On the client: System Properties >
    Change > select ''Domain'', and type the domain name. Authenticate as the domain
    administrator, then restart.'
