  m_text: 'LO3.2 - A server that blocks its own services is the most common cause
    of a connection that should work and does not.


    Start > Windows Defender
    Firewall. Under Inbound Rules, find the Remote Desktop rule and enable it.


    Turning
    the firewall off would also make the connection work, and would be the wrong
    answer. The rule is the fix, not the firewall.'
