  m_text: 'LO3.1 - TEST 3. Confirm the redirection policy took effect.


    On CLIENT01,
    signed in as student01, open Start > Documents and go to its Properties.


    Check
    the Location tab. A redirected folder looks completely normal until you look
    there.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
