  m_text: 'LO3.1 - TEST 4. Connect remotely from CLIENT01.


    Start > Remote Desktop
    Connection. Enter the server''s address and press Connect.


    The test passes
    when the remote session opens. Sign-in is as student01, not as an administrator
    - an administrator can always get in, so it would prove nothing about the permission
    you set.'
