  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "LO3.1 - PREPARE THE TEST PLAN\n\nA technician writes down what will be
    tested and what counts as a pass BEFORE testing, so nothing is skipped and the
    result is not decided after the fact.\n\nYour plan for this job:\n\n  1. Shared
    folder reachable from the client by UNC path\n  2. Shared printer prints a test
    page from the client\n  3. Redirected Documents folder points at the server\n 
    4. Remote Desktop connects from the client\n  5. Connectivity confirmed by ping\n\nEach
    one is performed on CLIENT01, because a service that has only been checked on
    the server has not been tested at all.\n\nTap NEXT to begin testing."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
