  m_text: 'LO1.1 - Back to the server. Publish the printer so clients can install
    it by name.


    Start > Devices and Printers. Select the printer, open Printer
    properties, and go to the Sharing tab.


    Share it, and list it in the directory.
    Sharing puts it on the network; listing is what lets a domain client find it
    without being told its address and driver.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
