  m_text: 'LO1.2 - Point the redirection policy at the folder you just made.


    Start
    > Group Policy Management. Under USER Configuration > Policies > Windows Settings
    > Folder Redirection, select Documents and press Properties.


    Set it to
    Basic, then enter the Root Path. It must be a network path - the client cannot
    reach the server''s C: drive.'
